<title>UK: Nat Power, PowerGen up on NatWest comment.</title>
<headline>Nat Power, PowerGen up on NatWest comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in National Power Plc and PowerGen Plc rose on Wednesday as analysts at NatWest Securities repeated an &quot;add&quot; rating on both stocks, dealers said.</p>
</text>
